---
import LifeShell from '../../components/LifeShell.astro';
---
<LifeShell current="yoga" title="Yoga · Eva Harboe" description="Eva Harboe's yoga teaching: 200-hour YTT from House of Om, weekly vinyasa classes for the Surrey Yoga Society.">
  <header class="sub-intro">
    <p class="kicker">Life</p>
    <h1>Yoga</h1>
  </header>
  <section>
    <h2 class="label">Training</h2>
    <div class="content">
      <p>
        I did my 200-hour yoga teacher training at House of Om in Ubud, Bali, a mix of vinyasa and hatha with
        some ashtanga and meditation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2 class="label">Teaching</h2>
    <div class="content">
      <p>
        Now I teach weekly classes for the Surrey Yoga Society, where I was president for two terms. Classes are
        open to complete beginners, and the focus has always been on making them feel like a community. Attendance
        doubled in the year I started teaching.
      </p>
      <p>
        My classes are usually rocket or power vinyasa, and sometimes slower stretching sessions with more of a
        yin feel. Lately I've been leaning towards yoga for runners: mobility, strength and recovery for people
        who spend a lot of time on their feet.
      </p>
      <!-- TODO(Eva): a photo of you teaching -->
      <dl class="figures">
        <div><dt>200hr</dt><dd>YTT certified</dd></div>
        <div><dt>~40</dt><dd>students a week</dd></div>
        <div><dt>4</dt><dd>retreats planned</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
</LifeShell>
